Package: dufs
Version: 0.47.0
Architecture: amd64
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ericbyz <ericbyz@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: systemd
Description: Lightweight file server with web UI and WebDAV (dufs)
 dufs is a distinctive utility file server: browse, upload, download, edit
 and share files from the NAS shared folder in any browser, with resume
 support and the WebDAV protocol for apps. Single musl static binary, zero
 dependencies. Web UI at http://<NAS>:18240 (basic auth credential
 generated at install, stored in /etc/dufs/dufs.env); serve root defaults
 to /Volume1/public.
 Upstream project: https://github.com/sigoden/dufs (Apache-2.0/MIT),
 packaged unmodified.
